              "notes": "Color shows the original radar-model radius minus a 0.0564 km reference sphere. It includes the asteroid’s global shape and is not height above a gravitational equipotential or independent measured topography. Colors are transferred from the full source surface to the displayed triangles. About 25% of the model was unseen or observed at high radar incidence; the polar extent is less well constrained. Cartographic relief and optional Sun lighting are display treatments."
